<title>FRANCE: Cap Q1 turnover rises to 4.5 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Cap Q1 turnover rises to 4.5 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 4,490    vs    3,097</p>
<p>NOTE - Cap Gemini gave its turnover in the Official Bulletin. It said the first quarter figures includes 760 million francs from Cap Gemini Consulting &amp; Brossard but no longer included Matra Cap Systemes. On a like-for-like basis, turnover for the information technology services part of the group rose 15.7 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
